4. SCPACK (LicenseRef-SCPACK)
----------------------------

Schwarz-Christoffel routines in gridgen-c acknowledge SCPACK by Lloyd
Nicholas Trefethen. We retain its permission and citation notice for the
related numerical routines in cgrid-tools. SCPACK version 2 (July 1983),
as distributed at https://www.netlib.org/conformal/scpdbl, states:

"the package may be freely copied and used, but reference to
 the above paper should be given in any publications arising
 from its use."

The referenced paper is:
L. N. Trefethen, "Numerical computation of the Schwarz-Christoffel
transformation", SIAM Journal on Scientific and Statistical Computing
1 (1980), 82-102.
